- Main Content --><div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-secondary/40 via-brand-primary/8 to-brand-secondary/20 dark:from-brand-primary/10 dark:via-brand-secondary/5 dark:to-transparent border-b border-brand-border"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 py-12 md:py-16 flex flex-col items-center text-center"><!-- Icon --><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-brand-primary/10 border border-brand-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-brand-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg></div><nav class="mb-3 text-xs text-brand-muted flex items-center gap-1.5"><a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors">Inicio</a><span>/</span><span class="text-brand-text font-medium">Contacto</span></nav><h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-brand-text leading-tight mb-3">Escríbenos</h1><p class="text-base md:text-lg text-brand-muted leading-relaxed max-w-xl font-light">¿Tienes dudas sobre el cuidado de tu perro senior? Te responderemos personalmente.</p></div></div><main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 py-10 md:py-14"><!-- Navigation back --><div class="mb-6"><a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm text-brand-primary hover:text-brand-primary-hover font-semibold gap-1 no-underline transition-colors back-btn"><span>← Volver al inicio</span></a></div><!-- Contact Form Container --><div class="bg-brand-card/50 dark:bg-slate-900/30 border border-brand-border/60 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 shadow-sm max-w-xl mx-auto"><form action="/api/contact" method="POST" class="space-y-6" data-contact-form><!-- Name Input --><div><label for="name" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand-text mb-2 font-sans">Tu nombre</label><input type="text" id="name" name="name" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-brand-bg/50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 border border-brand-border/80 focus:border-brand-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-primary/20 rounded-xl text-brand-text placeholder-brand-muted/50 focus:outline-none transition-all duration-200" placeholder="Ej. María García"></div><!-- Email Input --><div><label for="email" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand-text mb-2 font-sans">Tu correo electrónico</label><input type="email" id="email" name="email" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-brand-bg/50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 border border-brand-border/80 focus:border-brand-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-primary/20 rounded-xl text-brand-text placeholder-brand-muted/50 focus:outline-none transition-all duration-200" placeholder="Ej. maria@ejemplo.com"></div><!-- Subject Input --><div><label for="subject" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand-text mb-2 font-sans">Asunto</label><input type="text" id="subject" name="subject" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-brand-bg/50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 border border-brand-border/80 focus:border-brand-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-primary/20 rounded-xl text-brand-text placeholder-brand-muted/50 focus:outline-none transition-all duration-200" placeholder="Ej. Consulta sobre artrosis o alimentación"></div><!-- Message Textarea --><div><label for="message" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand-text mb-2 font-sans">Mensaje</label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="6" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-brand-bg/50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 border border-brand-border/80 focus:border-brand-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-primary/20 rounded-xl text-brand-text placeholder-brand-muted/50 focus:outline-none transition-all duration-200 resize-y" placeholder="Describe detalladamente tu consulta, la edad de tu perro y sus síntomas..."></textarea></div><!-- Anti-spam --><input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" style="position:absolute; left:-9999px;" aria-hidden="true"><input type="hidden" name="startedAt" value="1791495631924" data-started-at><!-- Redirección tras enviar --><input type="hidden" name="_redirect" value="https://cuidatuperroviejo.com/gracias"><div class="cf-turnstile" data-action="turnstile-spin-v1"></div><!-- Consentimiento (Checkbox) --><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><input type="checkbox" id="privacy-consent" required class="mt-1 h-4.5 w-4.5 rounded border-brand-border/80 text-brand-primary focus:ring-brand-primary/20 focus:ring-offset-0 accent-brand-primary cursor-pointer"><label for="privacy-consent" class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-light select-none cursor-pointer">Acepto el uso de mis datos exclusivamente para responder a esta consulta.<span class="block mt-0.5 text-[11px]">Consulta la <a href="/politica-de-privacidad" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-primary hover:underline font-normal">Política de Privacidad</a>.</span></label></div><!-- Submit Button --><div class="pt-2"><button type="submit" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-brand-primary hover:bg-brand-primary-hover active:scale-[0.98] text-white text-sm font-bold rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-75 disabled:hover:bg-brand-primary" data-submit-button><span class="hidden h-4 w-4 rounded-full border-2 border-white/40 border-t-white motion-safe:animate-spin" data-submit-spinner aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-submit-label>Enviar mensaje</span><svg class="w-4 h-4" data-submit-icon fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path><